000300 PROGRAM-ID.  TPOPRNT.
000500 AUTHOR.      KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000800
000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*     T P O P R N T                                  *
001200*   THIS SUB PROGRAM DOES THE ACTUAL PRINTING        *
001300*   OF A PURCHASE ORDER                              *
001400*                                                    *
001500******************************************************
001600*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
001700*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
 01800*      1. TPOPRTSL                                   *
001900*      2. TRELEASE                                   *
002000*      3. TRELBATC                                   *
002100*      4. TPOPRTBT                                   *
002200*      5. TPURORD                                    *
002300*      6. TUDCDOCK                                   *
002400******************************************************
002500
      *C  09/25/1992      DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6204
      *C  REVISED PARAGRAPHS 661-CHECK-FOR-ITEMS AND
      *C  62-CHECK-FOR-ITEMS TO AVOID EXECUTING STATEMENTS
      *C  SUCH AS, "IF PO-ITEM (SUB1) ...", WHEN SUB1 IS
      *C  GREATER THAN 15.  THE PO REPRINT FUNCTION ABENDED
      *C  WHENEVER A USER SPECIFIED EXACTLY 15 SPECIFIC PO
      *C  ITEMS TO BE PRINTED, AND AN IF STATEMENT LIKE THE
      *C  ONE ABOVE WAS EXECUTED WITH SUB1 = 16.
      *C
      *C 03/30/93         JEFF BUNGO    REQUEST #6282
      *C  UPDATED THE PO PRINT TO PRINT THE GAS ACCOUNTING
      *C  STRUCTURE IF THE PACD SWITCH IS SET TO "N".
      *C
      *C SEPT. 1994  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADDED CODE TO PRINT CHAT NUMBER AND ITS MANUFACTURER AND
      *C   TRADE NAME IF A CHAT NUMBER IS REFERENCED ON THE PURCHASE
      *C   ORDER ITEM.
      *C
      *C 12/01/1995  CA YODER   REQUEST #95-034
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT THE BUYER NAME AND DATE AT THE BOTTOM
      *C   OF THE PO FOR AUSTRALIA.  THESE TWO LINES AREN'T WRITTEN
      *C   TO THE TEMPORARY FILE (PRNTWORK); IT WAS EASIER TO WRITE
      *C   THE LINES WHEN THE PO IS BEING PRINTED.  IN ORDER TO
      *C   UTILIZE THIS FUNCTION, THE FIELD "MPLTINFO-PRNT-PO-FOOTER"
      *C   IN MPLTINFO (KEY=POPT) MUST BE SET TO "Y".
      *C
      *C 03/20/1996  JE COFFMAN VERBAL REQUEST FROM NANCY PRITCHETT
      *C   DUE TO A CHANGE IN THE WAY THAT THE POST OFFICE HANDLES
      *C   GOODYEAR, IT BECAME APPARENT THAT THEY NEEDED TO HAVE A
      *C   P.O. BOX ESTABLISHED. SINCE THEY COULD NOT GET ALL OF THE
      *C   NECESSARY ADDRESS INFORMATION PRINTED, WE DECIDED TO USE
      *C   THE ALTERNATE ADDRESS TO HANDLE THE DIFFERENCES. THEIR
      *C   PO HEADER INFORMATION IS NOW IN THE NORMAL ADDRESS AREA
      *C   AND THEIR SHIP TO ADDRESS IS IN THE ALTERNATE ADDRESS.
      *C
      *C 06/06/1996    JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C 11/06/1996    CA YODER    REQ #96-005
      *C   ADDED THE WORDS "CANCELLED" OR "MODIFIED" TO THE PO
      *C   IN THE MIDDLE OF THE PAGE (WHEN AN ORDER IS CANCELLED
      *C   OR MODIFIED).  ALSO REMOVED THE "CONFIRMING ORDER"
      *C   LITERAL FROM THESE POS.  THESE CHANGES ALLOW FOR
      *C   BETTER COMMUNCIATIONS TO THE VENDOR.
      *C
      *C 04/02/1997    CA YODER    REQ #6651
      *C   ADDED A CHECK TO SEE IF PLANT WANTS PURCHASE ORDERS TO
      *C   ALWAYS PRINT WITHOUT SPECIAL PRINT CHARACTERS.  IF SO,
      *C   THIS PROGRAM WILL CALL "TPOPRNT2" INSTEAD AND THEN
      *C   RETURN TO THE CALLING PROGRAM.
      *C
      *C 01/19/1998    CA YODER
      *C   TOOK OUT CALLS TO CLPAUSE2 SINCE IT WAS CAUSING A VERY
      *C   LONG DELAY TO PRINT LARGER PURCHASE ORDERS.
      *C
      *C 06/01/1998    CA YODER
      *C   ADDED COMMAND TO ATTACH Y2K VERBAGE TO FAXSTAR ORDERS
      *C   FOR LAWTON.
      *C
      *C 01/11/2001    CA YODER     (REQUEST:  K. ANDERSON)
      *C   REMOVED Y2K FAXSTAR LOGIC FOR LAWTON.
      *C
      *C 01/18/2001    CA YODER     (REQUEST:  K. ANDERSON)
      *C   MOVED FAX NUMBER FROM BUYER LINE TO THE PREVIOUS
      *C   LINE FOR LAWTON.
      *C
      *C 03/21/02  CA YODER        (NAPANEE REQUEST)
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT COMMENTS FROM MCFPCS7000 ON
      *C   PURCHASE ORDER, IF THE FILE EXISTS.
      *C
      *C 04/04/2003    GEISER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT ON SPECIAL FORM FOR SOCIAL CIRCLE.
      *C   THIS IS TO ACCOMMODATE MULITPLE PLANTS/BUYERS USING THE
      *C   SAME FAX*STAR SYSTEM.
      *C
      *C 05/30/2003    GEISER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT TERMS AND CONDITIONS PAGE FOR
      *C   SPARTANBURG AND SOCIAL CIRCLE USING FAX*STAR.
      *C
      *C 04/27/2004    CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT TERMS AND CONDITIONS PAGE FOR
      *C   LAWTON.
      *C
      *C 11/01/2004    CA YODER   REQUEST #2004-31751
      *C   CHANGED LAWTON'S TERMS AND CONDITIONS PAGE FROM "T&CS"
      *C   TO "T&C4F".
      *C
025400
