083700
083800 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING  BASE,
083900                           PO-PRINT-PARMS,
084000                           ESC-NAME,
084100                           LANGUAGE-PARMS.
084200
084300
084400 BEGIN-HERE.
           OPEN INPUT DPOITEM-I, MVALIDUM-I, MSTORERM-I, MPLTINFO-I,
                      DPORECD-I, DPODATAITM-I, DCOMMENT-I, DVENDOR-I,
                      DCHATNO, MBUYER-I.
      *-------- FIND OUT IF PLANT WANTS TO PRINT PO WITH NO SPECIAL
      *-------- CHARACTERS.  IF SO, CALL "TPOPRNT2" INSTEAD AND RETURN.
           MOVE "POPT"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               IF MPLTINFO-ASCII-PO-PRNTS = "N"
                   CALL "TPOPRNT2"    USING BASE,
                                            PO-PRINT-PARMS,
                                            ESC-NAME,
                                            LANGUAGE-PARMS
                   GOBACK.

084600     MOVE CHAR-1636PI TO COMP-PRT-SEQ.
           MOVE CHAR-10PI   TO REG-PRT-SEQ.
084700     MOVE IBM-DOUBLE-WIDE-OFF  TO NORMAL-1, NORMAL-2, NORMAL-3,
084800                            NORMAL-4, NORMAL-5, DBL-WIDE-OFF-SEQ,
                                  NORM-MOD-CANC, NORM-CANC.
084900     MOVE CHAR-5PI    TO EXPAND-1, EXPAND-2, EXPAND-3,
085000                         EXPAND-4, EXPAND-5, EXP-PRT-SEQ,
                               EXP-MOD-CANC, EXP-CANC.

           MOVE SPACES      TO SEDIVNCK-PARMS.
085100
085200     MOVE PO-NUMBER      TO  PO-ARG,
                                   SEDIVNCK-PO-NUMBER
085300                             BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           CALL "SEDIVNCK" USING BASE, SEDIVNCK-PARMS.

           MOVE "N"    TO SAVE-CHAT-SW.
           MOVE "CHAT" TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
085700     IF COND-WORD = 17
085800         NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
