               GO TO 62-PRINT-ACCTG-INFO.
           PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL CCRQDESC-LINE (SUB) = SPACES OR
                            SUB > 6
               MOVE CCRQDESC-LINE (SUB)     TO  PRTWK-DESC-LINE
               MOVE PRTWK-DESC              TO  PRNT-WORK-LINE
               MOVE 1                       TO  CTL
               PERFORM 621-WRITE-PRT-WORK-RCD
           END-PERFORM.

