           MOVE CHAT-MFR                TO  PRT-CHAT-MFR.
           MOVE CHAT-TRADE              TO  PRT-CHAT-TRADE.
           MOVE CHAT-INFO-LINE          TO  PRTWK-DESC-LINE.
           MOVE 1                       TO  CTL.
