224600* ARE SPOOLED THRU THE SYSTEM SPOOLER SO A PAGE IS    *
224700* AUTOMATICALLY ADVANCED BETWEEN PO PRINTOUTS.        *
224800* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
